---
import OptimizedImage from "../../../components/OptimizedImage.astro";
---
<div class="w-full"><OptimizedImage src="/assets/images/work/1f6a18f12f08.webp" alt="Cover" width="2400" height="1218" class="block w-full h-auto" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" /></div>

    <article class="px-6 mb:px-16 dt:px-35 pt-10">
      <header>
        <h1 class="font-extrabold text-2xl mb:text-[32px] leading-10">Lo nuot phai hat dua mat roi.. - 2021</h1>
        <p class="mt-1 font-extrabold text-[18px] mb:text-2xl leading-8 font-jp">Accidentally swallowed the watermelon seed</p>
        <p class="mt-3 text-[18px] leading-6 font-medium">Content and Illustration : Thuy An</p>
      </header>
      <p class="mt-5 text-[16px] leading-6 font-normal text-pretty wrap-break-word">・The book has been selected as one of the top 10 nominees in the 21st ehon writing contest by Bungeisha Publishing House.</p>
      <p class="mt-5 text-[16px] leading-6 font-normal text-pretty wrap-break-word"><a href="https://www.bungeisha.co.jp/ehon/result21.jsp" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="underline decoration-1 underline-offset-2">https://www.bungeisha.co.jp/ehon/result21.jsp</a></p>
      <p class="mt-5 text-[16px] leading-6 font-normal text-pretty wrap-break-word">・The book has been exhibited at:</p>
      <p class="mt-5 text-[16px] leading-6 font-normal text-pretty wrap-break-word">- The AFCC 2023 event held in Singapore - Vietnam Country of Focus exhibition<br>- One of the 5 Vietnamese authors exhibited at the Japanese Embassy in Vietnam - “Ehon Week - Book Connection Week”, on the occasion of the 50th anniversary of the establishment of diplomatic relations between Vietnam and Japan.</p>
      <p class="mt-5 text-[16px] leading-6 font-normal text-pretty wrap-break-word"><a href="https://shopee.vn/Combo-4-S%C3%A1ch-%C6%AF%C6%A1m-M%E1%BA%A7m-C%E1%BA%A3m-X%C3%BAc-cho-b%C3%A9-3-6-tu%E1%BB%95i-T%E1%BB%9B-%C3%B4m-c%E1%BA%ADu-%C4%91%C6%B0%E1%BB%A3c-kh%C3%B4ng-B%E1%BA%A1n-G%E1%BA%A5u-l%C3%A0m-Con-%E1%BB%A9-c%E1%BA%AFt-t%C3%B3c-L%E1%BB%A1-nu%E1%BB%91t-h%E1%BA%A1t-d%C6%B0a-h%E1%BA%A5u-i.157598084.14483051195" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="underline decoration-1 underline-offset-2">・The book was published in Vietnam - link here.</a></p>
      <p class="mt-5 text-[16px] leading-6 font-normal text-pretty wrap-break-word"><a href="https://www.yomo-ehon.com/products/1279" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="underline decoration-1 underline-offset-2">・The book was published in Japan - link here.</a></p>
      <p class="mt-5 text-[16px] leading-6 font-normal text-pretty wrap-break-word">Creating and illustrating this ehon book was a challenging process for me, as it coincided with a stressful period. Despite limited time due to studying abroad and working part-time, I decided to participate in a Japanese ehon illustration competition. Although I didn't win first place, being among the top 10 nominees as the only Vietnamese artist was a great honor. The book was inspired by a childhood joke about trees growing on one's head. I hope the book reaches more readers and introduces Vietnamese-authored ehon to a wider audience. Thank you for watching!</p>

      <section class="mt-14 mb:mt-16" aria-label="Artwork">
        <h2 class="sr-only">Artwork</h2>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 dt:grid-cols-2 gap-10 mb:gap-12.5 items-start">
        <div class="w-full mx-auto max-w-122.5"><OptimizedImage src="/assets/images/work/61a695b1e9f4.webp" alt="Artwork 1" width="1177" height="1200" class="block w-full h-auto rounded-md" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /></div>
        <div class="w-full mx-auto max-w-122.5"><OptimizedImage src="/assets/images/work/0a7977da1212.webp" alt="Artwork 2" width="1186" height="1200" class="block w-full h-auto rounded-md" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /></div>
        <div class="w-full mx-auto max-w-122.5"><OptimizedImage src="/assets/images/work/be740ce6a603.webp" alt="Artwork 3" width="1169" height="1200" class="block w-full h-auto rounded-md" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /></div>
        <div class="w-full mx-auto max-w-122.5"><OptimizedImage src="/assets/images/work/ada8f7fa80d9.webp" alt="Artwork 4" width="1197" height="1200" class="block w-full h-auto rounded-md" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /></div>
        <div class="w-full mx-auto max-w-122.5"><OptimizedImage src="/assets/images/work/95920d0635c9.webp" alt="Artwork 5" width="1183" height="1200" class="block w-full h-auto rounded-md" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /></div>
        <div class="w-full mx-auto max-w-122.5"><OptimizedImage src="/assets/images/work/ffd8527a2bf3.webp" alt="Artwork 6" width="1161" height="1200" class="block w-full h-auto rounded-md" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /></div>
        <div class="dt:col-span-2 mx-auto w-full max-w-250"><OptimizedImage src="/assets/images/work/2128b440d540.webp" alt="Artwork 7" width="2200" height="1119" class="block w-full h-auto rounded-md" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /></div>
        <div class="dt:col-span-2 mx-auto w-full max-w-250"><OptimizedImage src="/assets/images/work/7a2f41da8822.webp" alt="Artwork 8" width="2200" height="1119" class="block w-full h-auto rounded-md" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /></div>
        <div class="w-full mx-auto max-w-122.5"><OptimizedImage src="/assets/images/work/f87651deeba1.webp" alt="Artwork 9" width="1175" height="1200" class="block w-full h-auto rounded-md" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /></div>
        <div class="w-full mx-auto max-w-122.5"><OptimizedImage src="/assets/images/work/8f4533b9ceeb.webp" alt="Artwork 10" width="1197" height="1200" class="block w-full h-auto rounded-md" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /></div>
        <div class="w-full mx-auto max-w-122.5"><OptimizedImage src="/assets/images/work/df0bb3830ca5.webp" alt="Artwork 11" width="1162" height="1200" class="block w-full h-auto rounded-md" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /></div>
        <div class="w-full mx-auto max-w-122.5"><OptimizedImage src="/assets/images/work/e2857749c86b.webp" alt="Artwork 12" width="1200" height="1171" class="block w-full h-auto rounded-md" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /></div>
        <div class="w-full mx-auto max-w-122.5"><OptimizedImage src="/assets/images/work/6a3fb4d08bbd.webp" alt="Artwork 13" width="1194" height="1200" class="block w-full h-auto rounded-md" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /></div>
        <div class="w-full mx-auto max-w-122.5"><OptimizedImage src="/assets/images/work/a296023dc8b5.webp" alt="Artwork 14" width="1162" height="1200" class="block w-full h-auto rounded-md" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /></div>
        <div class="dt:col-span-2 mx-auto w-full max-w-250"><OptimizedImage src="/assets/images/work/e066aae831e7.webp" alt="Artwork 15" width="2200" height="1125" class="block w-full h-auto rounded-md" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /></div>
        <div class="dt:col-span-2 mx-auto w-full max-w-250"><OptimizedImage src="/assets/images/work/f5700a801e76.webp" alt="Artwork 16" width="2200" height="1129" class="block w-full h-auto rounded-md" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /></div>
        </div>
        </section>

      <div class="mt-18 mb:mt-22 flex flex-col items-center gap-10 mb:gap-11">
        <OptimizedImage src="/assets/images/work/c2a720693e81.webp" alt="Closing illustration" width="816" height="722" class="block w-50 h-50 mb:w-62.5 mb:h-62.5 rounded-full object-cover object-center mx-auto" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
        <p class="font-extrabold text-2xl mb:text-[32px] leading-10 text-center">Thanks for watching!</p>
      </div>

      <a href="/en/illustration" id="back-link" class="img-btn block w-34 h-6.5 mt-17 mb-21 bg-left!" style="background-image:url(/assets/icons/back.png)" aria-label="Back" title="Back"></a>
    </article>
